{"curationManifestSha256":"98e90b3603b34b437bc554810c21f01c4db44d10364211af114d30fde3d67bad","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1731","main":{"annotations":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"选自《关汉卿戏剧集》（人民文学出版社1976 年版）。关汉卿（约1230—约1300），号已斋叟，大都（今北京）人，元代戏曲作家。代表作有杂剧《窦娥冤》《救风尘》《望江亭》《鲁斋郎》《拜月亭》《调风月》《单刀会》等。《窦娥冤》是元杂剧的代表性作品，共四折，这里选的是第三折。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-1"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"外：“外末”的简称，传统戏曲中男性角色名。意思是正角之外的次要角色。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-2"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"着（zhuó）：命令。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-3"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"做公的：公人，官府里的公差。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-4"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"净：角色名，俗称“花脸”。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-5"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"科：古代戏曲剧本中指示角色动作、表情的用语。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-6"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"磨旗：摇旗。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-7"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"正旦：传统戏曲中的女主角。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-8"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"行动些：走快些。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-9"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"正宫：宫调之一。宫调，我国古代音乐以宫、商、角（jué）、变徵（zhǐ）、徵、羽、变宫为七声，以其中任何一声为主，均可构成一种调式，凡以宫声为主的调式称“宫”，以其他各声为主的称“调”，合称“宫调”。杂剧的每一折，由同一宫调的若干曲牌联成一套曲子。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-10"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"端正好：和下文的“滚绣球”“倘秀才”等都是曲牌名。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-11"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"不提防遭刑宪：没防备触犯刑律。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-12"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"怎不将天地也生埋怨：怎么不把天地呀深深地埋怨。生，甚、深。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-13"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"可怎生糊突了盗跖（zhí）、颜渊：可是怎么混淆了坏人和好人？糊突，同“糊涂”，这里是“混淆”的意思。跖，传说是春秋末年奴隶起义的首领，过去被诬称为“盗跖”。颜渊，孔子弟子，被推崇为“复圣”。盗跖、颜渊，这里泛指坏人和好人。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-14"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"错勘：错误地判断。勘，审问。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-15"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"纽：同“扭”。这里是“拘束”的意思。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-16"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"前合后偃（yǎn）：意思是前倾后仰，站不稳。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-17"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"哥哥行（háng）：哥哥那边。哥哥，对一般男子的客气称呼。行，表示处所。宋代和元代口语里自称或者称呼别人的词的后边，有时加“行”字，意思大致相当于“这边”“那边”或者“这里”“那里”。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-18"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"上朝取应：进京考试。取应，参加科举考试。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-19"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"餐刀：吃刀，挨刀。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-20"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"也么哥：元明戏曲中常用的衬词，无义。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-21"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"卜儿：元杂剧中的老年妇女角色。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-22"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"兀的：这，这个。与“不”连用，表示反问，如同说“这岂不”“怎的不”。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-23"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"咱（zá）：语气助词，表示祈使。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-24"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"冬时年节，月一十五：冬至和过年，初一和十五。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-25"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"瀽（jiǎn）：泼，倒。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-26"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"陌：量词，用于祭奠时所烧的纸钱，相当于“叠”。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-27"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"则是：只当是。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-28"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"念窦娥葫芦提当罪愆（qiān）：可怜我窦娥被官府糊里糊涂地判了死罪。葫芦提，当时的口语，“糊里糊涂”的意思。愆，罪过。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-29"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"干家缘：操劳家务。家缘，家务。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-30"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"烈：烧。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-31"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"荐：祭奠。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-32"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"不明不暗：糊里糊涂。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-33"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"白练：白色熟绢。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-34"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"旗枪：旗杆头。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-35"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"者：语气助词，用于句末，表示祈使。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-36"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"打甚么不紧：有什么要紧。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-37"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"站：这里指让窦娥站着。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-38"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"罚：这里是“发”的意思。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-39"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"也不见得湛湛青天：也显不出天理昭彰。湛湛，清明澄澈。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-40"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"红尘洒：洒在土地上。红尘，土地。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-41"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"苌弘化碧：苌弘是周朝的贤臣。相传他无罪被杀，他的血被蜀人藏起来，三年后变成了碧玉。碧，青绿色的美玉。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-42"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"望帝啼鹃：望帝是古代传说中蜀王杜宇的称号。相传他因水灾让位给他的臣子，自己隐居山中，死后化为杜鹃，日夜悲啼，直到吐血。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-43"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"天道：天气。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-44"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"暄：炎热。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-45"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"飞霜六月因邹衍：邹衍是战国时燕国的臣子。相传他遭谗言被囚禁，入狱时仰天大哭，当时正当夏天，竟然下起霜来。后来常用“六月飞霜”来表示冤狱。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-46"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"六出冰花：指雪花。雪的结晶体一般有六瓣，所以说“六出”。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-47"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"素车白马：指送葬的车马。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-48"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"断送出：发送往。断送，发送，指殡葬。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-49"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"楚州：州名，治所在山阳（今江苏淮安）。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-50"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"亢旱：大旱。亢，极。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-51"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"东海曾经孝妇冤：此事见于《说苑·贵德》《汉书·于定国传》等，记东海孝妇蒙冤被杀，郡中大旱三年。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-52"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"每：表示复数，相当于“们”。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-53"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"内：指后台。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-54"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"题：提。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11178-55"}],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"窦娥冤","type":"text"},{"label":"[1]","noteId":"footnote-11178-1","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"（节选）\n\n关汉卿","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"第三折\n\n（外","type":"text"},{"label":"[2]","noteId":"footnote-11178-2","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"扮监斩官上，云）下官监斩官是也。今日处决犯人，着","type":"text"},{"label":"[3]","noteId":"footnote-11178-3","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"做公的","type":"text"},{"label":"[4]","noteId":"footnote-11178-4","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"把住巷口，休放往来人闲走。（净","type":"text"},{"label":"[5]","noteId":"footnote-11178-5","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"扮公人，鼓三通、锣三下科","type":"text"},{"label":"[6]","noteId":"footnote-11178-6","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。刽子磨旗","type":"text"},{"label":"[7]","noteId":"footnote-11178-7","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"、提刀，押正旦","type":"text"},{"label":"[8]","noteId":"footnote-11178-8","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"带枷上。刽子云）行动些","type":"text"},{"label":"[9]","noteId":"footnote-11178-9","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，行动些，监斩官去法场上多时了。（正旦唱）","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"【正宫","type":"text"},{"label":"[10]","noteId":"footnote-11178-10","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"】【端正好","type":"text"},{"label":"[11]","noteId":"footnote-11178-11","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"】没来由犯王法，不提防遭刑宪","type":"text"},{"label":"[12]","noteId":"footnote-11178-12","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，叫声屈动地惊天。顷刻间游魂先赴森罗殿，怎不将天地也生埋怨","type":"text"},{"label":"[13]","noteId":"footnote-11178-13","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。\n\n【滚绣球】有日月朝暮悬，有鬼神掌着生死权。天地也！只合把清浊分辨，可怎生糊突了盗跖、颜渊","type":"text"},{"label":"[14]","noteId":"footnote-11178-14","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"？为善的受贫穷更命短，造恶的享富贵又寿延。天地也！做得个怕硬欺软，却原来也这般顺水推船！地也，你不分好歹何为地？天也，你错勘","type":"text"},{"label":"[15]","noteId":"footnote-11178-15","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"贤愚枉做天！哎，只落得两泪涟涟。\n\n（刽子云）快行动些，误了时辰也。（正旦唱）\n\n【倘秀才】则被这枷纽","type":"text"},{"label":"[16]","noteId":"footnote-11178-16","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"的我左侧右偏，人拥的我前合后偃","type":"text"},{"label":"[17]","noteId":"footnote-11178-17","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。我窦娥向哥哥行","type":"text"},{"label":"[18]","noteId":"footnote-11178-18","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"有句言。（刽子云）你有甚么话说？（正旦唱）前街里去心怀恨，后街里去死无冤，休推辞路远。\n\n（刽子云）你如今到法场上面，有甚么亲眷要见的，可教他过来，见你一面也好。（正旦唱）\n\n【叨叨令】可怜我孤身只影无亲眷，则落的吞声忍气空嗟怨。（刽子云）难道你爷娘家也没的？（正旦云）止有个爹爹，十三年前上朝取应","type":"text"},{"label":"[19]","noteId":"footnote-11178-19","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"去了，至今杳无音信。（唱）早已是十年多不睹爹爹面。（刽子云）你适才要我往后街里去，是甚么主意？（正旦唱）怕则怕前街里被我婆婆见。\n\n（刽子云）你的性命也顾不得，怕他见怎的？（正旦云）俺婆婆若见我披枷带锁赴法场餐刀","type":"text"},{"label":"[20]","noteId":"footnote-11178-20","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"去呵，（唱）枉将他气杀也么哥","type":"text"},{"label":"[21]","noteId":"footnote-11178-21","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，枉将他气杀也么哥。告哥哥，临危好与人行方便。\n\n（卜儿","type":"text"},{"label":"[22]","noteId":"footnote-11178-22","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"哭上科，云）天那，兀的","type":"text"},{"label":"[23]","noteId":"footnote-11178-23","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"不是我媳妇儿！（刽子云）婆子靠后。（正旦云）既是俺婆婆来了，叫他来，待我嘱咐他几句话咱","type":"text"},{"label":"[24]","noteId":"footnote-11178-24","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。（刽子云）那婆子近前来，你媳妇要嘱咐你话哩。（卜儿云）孩儿，痛杀我也！\n\n（正旦云）婆婆，那张驴儿把毒药放在羊肚儿汤里，实指望药死了你，要霸占我为妻。不想婆婆让与他老子吃，倒把他老子药死了。我怕连累婆婆，屈招了药死公公，今日赴法场典刑。婆婆，此后遇着冬时年节，月一十五","type":"text"},{"label":"[25]","noteId":"footnote-11178-25","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，有瀽","type":"text"},{"label":"[26]","noteId":"footnote-11178-26","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"不了的浆水饭， 瀽半碗儿与我吃；烧不了的纸钱，与窦娥烧一陌","type":"text"},{"label":"[27]","noteId":"footnote-11178-27","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"儿。\n\n则是","type":"text"},{"label":"[28]","noteId":"footnote-11178-28","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"看你死的孩儿面上！（唱）\n\n【快活三】念窦娥葫芦提当罪愆","type":"text"},{"label":"[29]","noteId":"footnote-11178-29","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，念窦娥身首不完全，念窦娥从前已往干家缘","type":"text"},{"label":"[30]","noteId":"footnote-11178-30","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"；婆婆也，你只看窦娥少爷无娘面。\n\n【鲍老儿】念窦娥伏侍婆婆这几年，遇时节将碗凉浆奠；你去那受刑法尸骸上烈","type":"text"},{"label":"[31]","noteId":"footnote-11178-31","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"些纸钱，只当把你亡化的孩儿荐","type":"text"},{"label":"[32]","noteId":"footnote-11178-32","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。（卜儿哭科，云）\n\n孩儿放心，这个老身都记得。天那，兀的不痛杀我也！（正旦唱）婆婆也，再也不要啼啼哭哭，烦烦恼恼，怨气冲天。这都是我做窦娥的没时没运，不明不暗","type":"text"},{"label":"[33]","noteId":"footnote-11178-33","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，负屈衔冤。\n\n（刽子做喝科，云）兀那婆子靠后，时辰到了也。（正旦跪科）（刽子开枷科）（正旦云）窦娥告监斩大人，有一事肯依窦娥，便死而无怨。（监斩官云）你有甚么事？你说。（正旦云）要一领净席，等我窦娥站立；又要丈二白练","type":"text"},{"label":"[34]","noteId":"footnote-11178-34","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，挂在旗枪","type":"text"},{"label":"[35]","noteId":"footnote-11178-35","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"上。若是我窦娥委实冤枉，刀过处头落，一腔热血休半点儿沾在地下，都飞在白练上者","type":"text"},{"label":"[36]","noteId":"footnote-11178-36","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。（监斩官云）这个就依你，打甚么不紧","type":"text"},{"label":"[37]","noteId":"footnote-11178-37","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。（刽子做取席站","type":"text"},{"label":"[38]","noteId":"footnote-11178-38","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"科，又取白练挂旗上科）（正旦唱）\n\n【耍孩儿】不是我窦娥罚","type":"text"},{"label":"[39]","noteId":"footnote-11178-39","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"下这等无头愿，委实的冤情不浅；若没些儿灵圣与世人传，也不见得湛湛青天","type":"text"},{"label":"[40]","noteId":"footnote-11178-40","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。我不要半星热血红尘洒","type":"text"},{"label":"[41]","noteId":"footnote-11178-41","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，都只在八尺旗枪素练悬。等他四下里皆瞧见，这就是咱苌弘化碧","type":"text"},{"label":"[42]","noteId":"footnote-11178-42","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，望帝啼鹃","type":"text"},{"label":"[43]","noteId":"footnote-11178-43","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。\n\n（刽子云）你还有甚的说话，此时不对监斩大人说，几时说那？（正旦再跪科，云）大人，如今是三伏天道","type":"text"},{"label":"[44]","noteId":"footnote-11178-44","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，若窦娥委实冤枉，身死之后，天降三尺瑞雪，遮掩了窦娥尸首。（监斩官云）这等三伏天道，你便有冲天的怨气，也召不得一片雪来，可不胡说！（正旦唱）\n\n【二煞】你道是暑气暄","type":"text"},{"label":"[45]","noteId":"footnote-11178-45","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，不是那下雪天；岂不闻飞霜六月因邹衍","type":"text"},{"label":"[46]","noteId":"footnote-11178-46","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"？若果有一腔怨气喷如火，定要感的六出冰花","type":"text"},{"label":"[47]","noteId":"footnote-11178-47","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"滚似绵，免着我尸骸现；要甚么素车白马","type":"text"},{"label":"[48]","noteId":"footnote-11178-48","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，断送出","type":"text"},{"label":"[49]","noteId":"footnote-11178-49","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"古陌荒阡？\n\n（正旦再跪科，云）大人，我窦娥死的委实冤枉，从今以后，着这楚州","type":"text"},{"label":"[50]","noteId":"footnote-11178-50","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"亢旱","type":"text"},{"label":"[51]","noteId":"footnote-11178-51","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"三年！（监斩官云）打嘴！那有这等说话！（正旦唱）\n\n【一煞】你道是天公不可期，人心不可怜，不知皇天也肯从人愿。做甚么三年不见甘霖降？也只为东海曾经孝妇冤","type":"text"},{"label":"[52]","noteId":"footnote-11178-52","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。如今轮到你山阳县。这都是官吏每","type":"text"},{"label":"[53]","noteId":"footnote-11178-53","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"无心正法，使百姓有口难言。\n\n（刽子做磨旗科，云）怎么这一会儿天色阴了也？（内","type":"text"},{"label":"[54]","noteId":"footnote-11178-54","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"做风科，刽子云）好冷风也！（正旦唱）\n\n【煞尾】浮云为我阴，悲风为我旋，三桩儿誓愿明题","type":"text"},{"label":"[55]","noteId":"footnote-11178-55","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"遍。（做哭科，云）婆婆也，直等待雪飞六月，亢旱三年呵，（唱）那其间才把你个屈死的冤魂这窦娥显。\n\n（刽子做开刀，正旦倒科）（监斩官惊云）呀，真个下雪了，有这等异事！（刽子云）我也道平日杀人，满地都是鲜血，这个窦娥的血都飞在那丈二白练上，并无半点落地，委实奇怪。（监斩官云）这死罪必有冤枉。早两桩儿应验了，不知亢旱三年的说话准也不准，且看后来如何。左右，也不必等待雪晴，便与我抬他尸首，还了那蔡婆婆去罢。（众应科，抬尸下）","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"王国维曾说，《窦娥冤》“即列之于世界大悲剧中，亦无愧色”（《宋元戏曲史》）。窦娥悲惨的命运令人同情，造成她悲剧的原因引人深思。 阅读本文时要注意体会剧作家在窦娥这个人物身上寄托的思想感情，思考她指斥天地、痛发誓愿的反抗有什么样的意义和价值。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"《窦娥冤》属于元杂剧中的“本色派”作品，说白凝练而又生动流畅，唱词优美而又节奏鲜明，深刻地展示了人物的内心世界。要反复诵读，欣赏作品极富表现力的语言。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"}],"frontMatter":[],"guidance":[],"links":[],"media":[],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":11178,"sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"5487243dd8d14d65dfadc20ed544a999aaa318fc20c291462ea62c69e1eff320","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-07-30.2","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-1","postId":11178,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-1","text":"[1]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-2","postId":11178,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-2","text":"[2]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-3","postId":11178,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-3","text":"[3]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-4","postId":11178,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-4","text":"[4]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-5","postId":11178,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-5","text":"[5]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-6","postId":11178,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-6","text":"[6]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-7","postId":11178,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-7","text":"[7]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-8","postId":11178,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-8","text":"[8]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-9","postId":11178,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-9","text":"[9]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-10","postId":11178,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-10","text":"[10]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-11","postId":11178,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-11","text":"[11]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-12","postId":11178,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-12","text":"[12]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-13","postId":11178,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-13","text":"[13]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-14","postId":11178,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-14","text":"[14]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-15","postId":11178,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-15","text":"[15]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-16","postId":11178,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-16","text":"[16]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-17","postId":11178,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-17","text":"[17]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-18","postId":11178,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-18","text":"[18]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-19","postId":11178,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-19","text":"[19]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-20","postId":11178,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-20","text":"[20]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-21","postId":11178,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-21","text":"[21]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-22","postId":11178,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-22","text":"[22]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-23","postId":11178,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11178-23","text":"[23]","title":null}